{"4144360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Daemon: The Wolf, The Witch, and the Labyrinth", "steam_appid": 4144360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPESHIFT TO SURVIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly switch between <strong>wolf agility</strong> and <strong>werewolf ferocity</strong> in real time.<br>Adapt your form mid-combat to strike, evade, overwhelm, or escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/ff729d1ca5de085b2bc79f8d13404540.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/ff729d1ca5de085b2bc79f8d13404540.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/ff729d1ca5de085b2bc79f8d13404540.mp4?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>VISCERAL, MELEE-FOCUSED COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through corrupted beasts and spirit-bound enemies with weighty, aggressive combat inspired by souls-like encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/88e74fd2511872f28b1a36f438bca3a0.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/88e74fd2511872f28b1a36f438bca3a0.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/88e74fd2511872f28b1a36f438bca3a0.mp4?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS DAEMON?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daemon</strong> is a third-person action RPG built around real-time shapeshifting combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between wolf agility and werewolf ferocity to battle corrupted guardians and reclaim memories scattered across a shifting spirit realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Between Dream and Death</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soul awakens—trapped in the body of a cursed wolf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/c3dcad90e56e213d59863e5bf1e377e5.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/c3dcad90e56e213d59863e5bf1e377e5.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/c3dcad90e56e213d59863e5bf1e377e5.mp4?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As fragments of forgotten memory resurface, you’ll uncover the truth behind the curse that binds you—and confront what you’ve become.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A SHIFTING SPIRIT REALM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across mist-shrouded islands, storm-torn ruins, and ancient living forests where powerful spirits take form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/459aa51e847d843bfd6287c3152f72b8.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/459aa51e847d843bfd6287c3152f72b8.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/459aa51e847d843bfd6287c3152f72b8.mp4?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by spirits both kind and cruel, your path winds through places that remember what was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐺 <strong>Dual-Form Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift between an agile wolf and a powerful were-form to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adapt in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >traverse hostile terrain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >interact with the world in different ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌲 <strong>Mystical Exploration</strong><br>Traverse maze-like <strong>islands</strong> filled with living forests, hidden lore, and ancient spirits guarding deeper mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/008c852c1be8eabdd74ac2b4dc27282f.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/008c852c1be8eabdd74ac2b4dc27282f.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💀 <strong>Boss Encounters</strong><br>Challenge corrupted guardians born from nature and memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim their power to awaken new abilities and push deeper into the spirit realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/b02db7536dec812a75177f620b4d21f5.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/b02db7536dec812a75177f620b4d21f5.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/b02db7536dec812a75177f620b4d21f5.mp4?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Spirit Growth</strong> <br>Gather <strong>Wisdom</strong> from defeated spirits to evolve your forms, unlock new combat techniques, and reclaim fragments of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/ab3b7be10443f505179bfcbd1391d8e8.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/ab3b7be10443f505179bfcbd1391d8e8.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/ab3b7be10443f505179bfcbd1391d8e8.mp4?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Atmospheric Storytelling</strong><br>Experience a <strong>haunting tale of loss &amp; transformation </strong>—told through exploration, discovery, and the voices of the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/6e68edbb2789ed9627544549bb71f531.poster.avif?t=1774630777\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4144360/extras/6e68edbb2789ed9627544549bb71f531.webm?t=1774630777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shar